msgstr "3.1 罗技 F710"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:52
#: 02da5640a184497d8cae47f571eca144
msgid ""
"The F710 connects over 2.4G. The receiver sits in the shell on the back. "
"X86 accepts both switch positions. Jetson Thor uses X-input. RK3588 uses "
"D-input."
msgstr "F710 走 2.4G。接收器在背面壳子里。X86 两个档位都可用。Jetson Thor 用 X-input。RK3588 用 D-input。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:54
#: d5e2733e3b834b73a5ac58a8bb0284da
msgid ""
"Under `game_controller_node`, X and D share `generic_gamepad.yaml`. With "
"`joy_driver:=joy`, use `default.yaml` and restart the launch after you "
"flip the switch. That split is in the [package README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)."
msgstr "在 `game_controller_node` 下，X 档和 D 档共用 `generic_gamepad.yaml`。使用 `joy_driver:=joy` 时用 `default.yaml`，拨动开关后重新启动这次 launch。这个区分写在[软件包 README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。"

