#: 862cd6f1628d4dafaba2229f665134d9
msgid "3.3 小鸡超新星"
msgstr "3.3 小鸡超新星"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:68
#: c0fbd8ed647046f2a7eeaa568e9e0c67
msgid ""
"This controller comes with the 灵猴二代 chassis. Turn it on from the back, "
"select 2.4G, plug in USB, and press Home. Hold **−** and **+** together "
"to change the radio mode."
msgstr "这只手柄随灵猴二代底盘附带。从背面开机，选 2.4G，插上 USB，再按 Home。同时按住 **−** 和 **+** 切换无线模式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:70
#: 4a8a20fc39964baf9d4d2ac10e59777e
msgid ""
"Use Xbox mode. Switch mode uses a different button map, so leave it off. "
"On RK3588 the check passed only in PS4 mode. On X86 and Jetson Thor every"
" mode except Switch passed. Pairing steps are in the [Nova Pro "
"guide](https://doc.xiaoji.com/zh/nova-pro/)."
msgstr "用 Xbox 模式。Switch 模式的键位映射不同。RK3588 上只通过了 PS4 模式。X86 和 Jetson Thor 上，除 Switch 以外的模式都通过了。配对步骤见 [Nova Pro 说明](https://doc.xiaoji.com/zh/nova-pro/)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:72
#: 7e75bf35201b45878ab34d01b5f7118c
