msgid ""
"`keyboard_teleop` uses the same `control_input` and `teleop_mode` "
"contract. Run it in its own terminal so stdin is a real TTY:"
msgstr ""
"`keyboard_teleop` 使用同一套 `control_input` 和 "
"`teleop_mode`。把它放在自己的终端里跑，这样标准输入才是真正的 TTY："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:107
#: ecc87ffff4b54bdc938e34f395eedd88
msgid "ros2 run arms_teleop keyboard_teleop"
msgstr "ros2 run arms_teleop keyboard_teleop"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:111
#: 6f82c3d2c2e24843b4183bc648818b45
msgid ""
"The key map (WASD, arm / chassis, mirror, speed, gripper) is [section 4 "
"of the package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md). "
"`/fsm_command` comes from the joystick. The same `quick_start.sh` assist "
"menu has a keyboard entry, and that entry takes the current terminal."
msgstr ""
"按键表（WASD、手臂 / 底盘、镜像、速度、夹爪）在[软件包 README 第 4 节](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。`/fsm_command`"
" 由手柄发出。同一个 `quick_start.sh` 辅助菜单里有键盘一项，那一项会占用当前终端。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:113
#: 7d04c46f522046cc8c844ede7fa78f30
msgid "6. What you should see"
msgstr "​6. 预期看到的结果"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:115
#: f7cdc737ab97467991362b639c77729f
msgid ""
"After the right-stick enable, stick motion moves the active arm, or the "
"chassis in chassis mode. `teleop_mode.active` is true after that enable. "
"On the keyboard it is already true."
msgstr ""
"右摇杆打开之后，摇杆移动当前手臂；底盘模式下则移动底盘。打开之后 `teleop_mode.active` 为 true。键盘上它一开始就是 "
"true。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:117
#: 452bcaa5fa91465d93e178303b169b9b
msgid "6.1 Control-input HUD"
msgstr "6.1 控制输入 HUD"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:119
#: db046a1989c44dbe9671be8dac928b78
msgid ""
"With the joystick running, RViz shows one teleop card at the top left of "
"the 3D view. That card is `TeleopMode` plus the active arm: `ARM` `L` or "
"`R` (`Inputs.target`), `MIRROR` for `mirror_movement`, and `SPD` "
"`LOW`/`HIGH` for `speed_level`. On the card, `R` is orange, `L` is blue, "
"`MIRROR ON` is gold, `MIRROR OFF` is muted, `SPD HIGH` is gold, and `SPD "
"LOW` is blue."
msgstr ""
"手柄在跑时，RViz 三维视图左上角有一张遥操卡片。卡片是 `TeleopMode` 加上当前臂：`ARM` 的 `L` 或 "
"`R`（`Inputs.target`），`MIRROR` 对应 `mirror_movement`，`SPD` 的 `LOW`/`HIGH` "
"对应 `speed_level`。卡片上 `R` 为橙色，`L` 为蓝色，`MIRROR ON` 为金色，`MIRROR OFF` "
"为暗色，`SPD HIGH` 为金色，`SPD LOW` 为蓝色。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:121
#: df26d4c18e644ef7957a0d0cf3d0da1b
msgid ""
"The clip is a FiveAges W2 in `fullbody.rviz`. The card moves between the "
"right arm and the left arm, turns mirror on and off, and steps speed "
"between low and high. When the FSM enters OCS2, the FSM panel, joint "
"panel, and MPC readout appear beside it."
msgstr ""
"这段是第五纪 W2 在 `fullbody.rviz` 里的画面。卡片在右臂和左臂之间切换，镜像开合，速度在低档和高档之间变化。FSM 进入 "
"OCS2 后，旁边会出现 FSM 面板、关节面板和 MPC 读数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:123
#: eb70244de2524e0c8e513d5be37c250a
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/joystick-rviz-hud.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/joystick-rviz-hud.mp4\" "
"type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:129
#: a93e17995aae486baa5563203f30bfae
msgid "7. Topics"
msgstr "​7. 话题"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:131
#: ec43c88da29a4764a4081d7e335467dc
msgid ""
"The joystick publishes `control_input` (`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`),"
" `teleop_mode` (`arms_ros2_control_msgs/TeleopMode`), `/cmd_vel` in "
"chassis mode, the waist commands, and `/fsm_command`. "
"`arms_target_manager` turns `control_input` into `left_target/twist` and "
"`right_target/twist`."
msgstr ""
"手柄发布 "
"`control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）、`teleop_mode`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/TeleopMode`），底盘模式下还有"
" `/cmd_vel`，以及腰部命令和 `/fsm_command`。`arms_target_manager` 把 "
"`control_input` 转成 `left_target/twist` 和 `right_target/twist`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:133
#: 20fbab36679f4bbdb67ab8e05876358c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Field names, types, and QoS for `teleop_mode` and `control_input` are on "
"{ref}`Teleop topics and data <teleop-topics-and-data>`. Headset, foot "
"pedal, and exoskeleton mode fields are on that same page."
msgstr ""
"`teleop_mode` 和 `control_input` 的字段名、类型和 QoS 在 {ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 <teleop-"
"topics-and-data>`。头显、脚踏板和外骨骼的模式字段也在那一页。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:136
#: c2f4d2479a134fe987abc162a3c8957c
msgid "8. Foot pedal"
msgstr "​8. 脚踏板"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:138
#: 720d8204e5cd460b90c989e16ad60ce0
msgid ""
"`foot_pedal_teleop` is an assist next to the joystick or the keyboard. It"
" reads one USB pedal (the packaged udev rule is for the SayoDevice CM6K) "
"and publishes event codes on the relative topic `teleop/controller_state`"
" (`std_msgs/Int32`). `VRInputHandler` applies those events and publishes "
"the current mode on `teleop/mode_state` (`TeleopModeState`)."
msgstr ""
"`foot_pedal_teleop` 是手柄或键盘旁边的辅助输入。它读一块 USB 脚踏板（包内 udev 规则面向 SayoDevice "
"CM6K），在相对话题 "
"`teleop/controller_state`（`std_msgs/Int32`）上发布事件码。`VRInputHandler` "
"处理这些事件，并把当前模式发到 `teleop/mode_state`（`TeleopModeState`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:140
#: 03dcf2eb36f344e8a457791f3ff7a7df
msgid "Run the pedal in the same namespace as that robot’s `arms_target_manager`:"
msgstr "把脚踏板跑在该机器人 `arms_target_manager` 的同一命名空间里："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:142
#: ca110f5117be4ef8a3d382dab9e11542
msgid ""
"ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop --ros-args -r __ns:=/robot_a\n"
"ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"
msgstr ""
"ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop --ros-args -r __ns:=/robot_a\n"
"ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:147
#: d5e2733e3b834b73a5ac58a8bb0284da
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"With one supported pedal and an empty namespace, `ros2 run arms_teleop "
"foot_pedal_teleop` is enough; the status topic is then "
"`/teleop/mode_state`. The event map (FSM up/down, left/right arm teleop, "
"STORAGE/UPDATE, mirror), udev, and how to pick a device when several "
"pedals are connected are in the [package README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)."
" Mode fields are on {ref}`Teleop topics and data <teleop-topics-and-"
"data>`."
msgstr ""
"只接了一块受支持的脚踏板、且命名空间为空时，`ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop` 即可；此时状态话题是"
" `/teleop/mode_state`。事件表（FSM "
"上/下、左右臂遥操、STORAGE/UPDATE、镜像）、udev，以及接了多块脚踏板时如何选设备，在[软件包 "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。模式字段在 "
"{ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 <teleop-topics-and-data>`。"

